OL,3,GNEWSAPlumber's plot with 'The Baron' to
OL,4,Asmuggle cocaine abroad inside rope
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man living in a caravan conspired
OL,7,Fwith a mysterious contact, known only
OL,8,Fas 'The Baron', to ship kilos of
OL,9,Fcocaine and ketamine hidden inside
OL,10,Fhollowed-out rope to the other side of
OL,11,Fthe world.
OL,13,FGavin Smith, 44, of Swansea Road,
OL,14,FPontlliw, in Swansea, was drawn into a
OL,15,Fplot to smuggle drugs from Wales to New
OL,16,FZealand.
OL,18,FThe operation was exposed after South
OL,19,FWales Police arrested Smith for
OL,20,Funrelated matters and found the unit on
OL,21,Fan industrial estate from where he was
OL,22,Frunning a cannabis-dealing business.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
